@startuml
title Ott Based System Mini Reel — Polished Requirement Specification

state "Create Account" as CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry / User not logged in
CreateAccount : do / Fill registration details
CreateAccount : exit / Registration successful

state "Watch Videos" as WatchVideos
WatchVideos : entry / User logged in
WatchVideos : do / Browse and watch videos
WatchVideos : exit / Video watched

state "Upload Videos" as UploadVideos
UploadVideos : entry / User logged in
UploadVideos : do / Upload video to system
UploadVideos : exit / Video uploaded successfully

state "Save Videos" as SaveVideos
SaveVideos : entry / User watching video
SaveVideos : do / Add video to likes list
SaveVideos : exit / Video saved successfully

state "View Saved Videos" as ViewSavedVideos
ViewSavedVideos : entry / User logged in
ViewSavedVideos : do / Browse and view saved videos
ViewSavedVideos : exit / Video viewed from saved list

state "Discussion Option" as DiscussionOption
DiscussionOption : entry / User watching video
DiscussionOption : do / Enter discussion option
DiscussionOption : exit / Discussion entered successfully

[*] --> CreateAccount

CreateAccount --> WatchVideos
WatchVideos --> UploadVideos
UploadVideos --> SaveVideos
SaveVideos --> ViewSavedVideos
ViewSavedVideos --> DiscussionOption

DiscussionOption --> [*]

@enduml
